# Store every file exactly as it is on disk.
#
# This tree is deliberately mixed: CHANGELOG.md, README.md, manifest.json and
# tests/celebi_event_test.lua are CRLF, main.lua and mod.card are LF, and the
# release archive is built from the tree byte for byte.  With
# core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) and no attributes file, Git
# would store LF and hand back CRLF, so a fresh clone would not match the tree
# the .zip was built from.  -text turns that conversion off without giving up
# text diffs.
* -text

# Archives and art: never text, never diffed.
*.zip binary
*.modpkg binary
*.png binary
